23789 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 23790 0 R/Alt(Path diagram in black and white. Expected evidence and unexpected evidence, on the left and each against no information, point to evidence relevance (the ten-item mean), which points to pregnancy-evidence likelihood, which points to confidence in the ruling on the right; both kinds of evidence also point to consequence severity, which points to foreseeability, which points to confidence. Each path carries its unstandardized estimate and robust Wald 95% interval; the evidence paths and the paths into confidence carry one value per legal context, tagged Abortion and Disposal; a solid path marks an interval that excludes zero and a dashed path one that includes it.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[2]/Pg 48639 0 R>>
endobj
