26944 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 26945 0 R/Alt(Two panels. In each, the horizontal axis lists the three search targets (reverse keyword warrant, provider text-message warrant and physical home search) and the vertical axis gives the adjusted mean certainty required, as black points with 95% interval whiskers joined by lines; the series are told apart by marker (filled or open circles and squares) and line type. The left panel shows one series, the six conditions weighted equally; the right panel shows one series for each outcome condition (no information, expected evidence and unexpected evidence), the two legal contexts averaged.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[2]/Pg 48684 0 R>>
